  m_text: "A survival game where you wake up stranded \r\non a remote island with
    no memory. \r\n\r\nGather resources, craft tools, build shelter, \r\nand survive
    as long as you can.\r\n\r\nFight hunger, thirst, and dangerous wildlife \r\nwhile
    uncovering the mystery of how you got here."
